<title>UK: FTC seeks more info on Energy TEG., PacifiCorp.</title>
<headline>FTC seeks more info on Energy TEG., PacifiCorp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Energy Group said on Monday it had received a second request for additional information from the U.S. Federal Trade Commission (FTC) in connection with its merger with PacifiCorp.</p>
</text>
